      "text": "Fast Response Cutters have proven their value — interdicting drugs, saving lives, securing borders and maritime approaches. \n\nNow, 10 more FRCs are joining the fleet through $1B in the One Big Beautiful Bill Act. This growing cutter fleet continues our modernization under Force Design 2028, ensuring @USCG is agile, capable, & ready to meet our Nation’s most urgent needs. \n\nRead more: https://t.co/Fo3tlpNrQD \n\n#USCG #ForceDesign2028 @DHSgov",
