      "text": "1,000 interdictions. \n\nFor over 20 years, @USCG HITRON has delivered decisive results at sea—stopping narco-terrorists and preventing billions of dollars in illicit drugs from reaching American shores. Recently, HITRON completed its 1,000th interdiction of a narco-trafficking vessel. \n\nRelentless force and precision in America’s fight against cartels.  \n\n🔗 Read the full @USCG release: https://t.co/vISVPbLflc\n\n#USCG #HITRON #WeOwnTheSea #MaritimeSecurity #TipoftheSpear @DHSgov",
