      "text": "The @USCG is the Nation’s frontline maritime interdiction force — deterring unlawful migration & defending sovereignty.  \n \nThis week, USCGC Heriberto Hernandez interdicted an unlawful voyage & repatriated 66 Illegal aliens.  \n \nAlways vigilant, the Coast Guard is on watch across 31,000 miles of borders — protecting America’s territorial integrity & sovereignty.  \n \nPress Release: Coast Guard repatriates 66 aliens following an unlawful voyage vessel interdiction in Mona Passage waters off Puerto Rico > United States Coast Guard News > Press Releases  \n\n#USCG #MaritimeSecurity #ImmigrationEnforcement \n\n@DHSgov @USCGSoutheast @USCGLANTAREA",
