      "text": "Our readiness depends on the state of our fleet. @USCG has awarded a $68.9M contract to design and build two HC-130J hangars in Kapolei, HI. These shelters will protect our aircraft from the harsh environment at Air Station Barbers Point, ensuring longevity and mission readiness across the Indo-Pacific. \n\nThrough Force Design 2028, we continue to transform asset lifecycle management and empower our crews across the Nation’s frontlines. \n\nRead more here: https://t.co/nRcPReaVAO\n\n#USCG #Readiness #Aviation #ForceDesign2028 @DHSgov",
